				<u>HF</u>
				1204
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				29.16
			</span></i>: 
				Aeol.
			 in this sense acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1090.27
			</span></i>; it occurs in broken context, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				11.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>body</i>, <i><span class="en">
